2
00:12:35,294 --> 00:12:41,294
An assassin on a final assignment in
Fuerteventura, to kill a man he has never met.

3
00:18:52,941 --> 00:18:58,941
When his target is delayed, he finds himself drawn to the
island, people and a ghostly shipwreck.

4
