13
01:21:49,411 --> 01:21:55,411
American Star is a 2024 British thriller film directed by Gonzalo López-Gallego,
written by Nacho Faerna, and produced by Ian McShane and Michael Elliott.

14
01:28:07,058 --> 01:28:13,058
The film stars McShane, Thomas Kretschmann, Nora Arnezeder,
Adam Nagaitis, Fanny Ardant, and Oscar Coleman.

15
01:34:24,705 --> 01:34:30,705
American Star was released in theaters and also digitally on 26 January 2024 in the United States
by IFC Films, and in the United Kingdom on 23 February 2024 by Vertigo Releasing.

